This isn't safe. If someone calls query.is_empty() in parallel on a mutable query, we have created aliased muts:

```rust
fn test(query: Query<&mut u32>, tasks: Res<ComputeTaskPool>) {
    tasks.scope(|s| {
        let q = &query;
        s.spawn(async move {
            q.is_empty();
        });
        s.spawn(async move {
            q.is_empty();
        })
    });
}
```
